# etf_price_daily is produced again -- the per-index view charts every wrapper
# rebased to 100 -- but deliberately stays out of git. Every run rewrites the
# whole history rather than a delta, so committing it would add ~260KB of
# near-duplicate parquet per trading day, and nothing needs the parquet
# versioned: the dashboard reads the trailing window embedded in the published
# artifact, which the daily workflow does commit.
data/normalized/market_monitor/etf_price_daily/
