# SHKP backtest outputs feed build_asia_backtest_registry.py, whose result is
# itself committed. Left ignored, a clean checkout regenerates the registry
# without any SHKP row (42 instead of 55) and overwrites the committed copy, so
# the asia-backtest tests could only ever pass on the machine that happened to
# hold these files locally.
